    dialogues:
    - name: Sketon
      lines:
      - "Th\u01B0a \xF4ng R\u1EEBng, k\u1EBB th\xF9 ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1EE7a
        con l\xE0 Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt"
      - "Con ph\u1EA3i chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED1i
        ph\xF3 v\u1EDBi h\u1EAFn \u0111\xE2y?"
    - name: "Th\u1EA7n R\u1EEBng"
      lines:
      - "Sketon, nh\u1EEFng \u0111o\u1EA1n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
        s\u1EBD l\u1EAFm ch\xF4ng gai"
      - "V\xE0 t\u1EA5t nhi\xEAn, \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ED1i ph\xF3 v\u1EDBi t\xEAn
        th\u1EA7n ch\u1EBFt n\xE0y, CON PH\u1EA2I CHU\u1EA8N B\u1ECA!!!"
